  "user_request_original": "Design a 22-layer planar multilayer filter on Daimon-20 substrate with air incidence. Layer sequence from air side: ZnS, MgF2, ZnS, MgF2, ZnS, MgF2, ZnS, MgF2, ZnS, MgF2, ZnS, MgF2, ZnS, MgF2, ZnS, MgF2, ZnS, MgF2, ZnS, MgF2, ZnS, MgF2, then Daimon-20 substrate. Optimize all 22 layer thicknesses individually to maximize transmittance in 3250-3350 nm and 4200-4300 nm bands while minimizing transmittance in 2500-3100 nm and 4450-5000 nm bands. No metal layers. Total layer count is exactly 22. Materials are zns and mgf2 from the material catalog. Substrate is Daimon-20. Incidence is from air side at normal incidence (0 degrees). Wavelength range of interest is 2500-5000 nm.",
